<% const t=site.data.timeline, iv=site.data.interviews; %>
<section class="hero">
<div class="hero-copy"><h1>花开有时，<br>相逢<span>有声。</span></h1><p class="hero-names"><span>董卿</span><span>周涛</span></p><p class="intro">从荧屏上的交相辉映，到文字里的娓娓道来。<br>收起时光的片羽，慢慢读她们的故事。</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="<%= url_for('/interviews/') %>">听她们说 <span><svg class="icon-arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12L12 4M4 4h8v8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span></a></div><p class="hero-range">1968 <span></span> 2025 <small>岁月有迹，温柔有声</small></p></div>
<div class="hero-art"><img class="kapok-branch" src="<%= url_for('/assets/kapok-canopy.svg') %>" alt="手绘木棉花枝"><div class="portrait-pair"><a class="portrait portrait-zhou" href="<%= url_for('/zhou-tao/') %>"><img src="<%= url_for('/assets/home-2016-duo.jpg') %>" alt="周涛"><span>周涛 <small>ZHOU TAO</small> <svg class="icon-arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12L12 4M4 4h8v8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span></a><a class="portrait portrait-dong" href="<%= url_for('/dong-qing/') %>"><img src="<%= url_for('/assets/home-2016-duo.jpg') %>" alt="董卿"><span>董卿 <small>DONG QING</small> <svg class="icon-arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12L12 4M4 4h8v8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span></a></div><i class="petal petal-one"></i><i class="petal petal-two"></i></div>
</section>
<section class="archive-intro"><p class="eyebrow">一份持续生长的记忆</p><p>让散落的年份、影像与访谈，<br><strong>在这里，有迹可循。</strong></p><div class="stats"><div><b><%= t.length %></b><span>年表记录</span></div><div><b><%= iv.length %></b><span>访谈与阅读</span></div><div><b>58</b><span>年份跨度</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section-block selected"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">A FEW MOMENTS / 时光拾页</p><h2>记忆里，有她们的声音</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="<%= url_for('/together/') %>">更多共同记忆 <svg class="icon-arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12L12 4M4 4h8v8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></a></div><div class="selected-grid"><% [[45,'2005','第一次，同台春晚','image11.jpeg'],[72,'2008','奥运盛夏，共同见证','image31.jpeg'],[150,'2016','元宵月圆，再听熟悉的声音','image119.jpeg']].forEach(v=>{ %><a class="selected-item" href="<%= url_for('/together/') %>#t<%= String(v[0]).padStart(3,'0') %>"><img loading="lazy" src="<%= url_for('/assets/archive/'+v[3]) %>" alt="<%= v[1] %>年舞台资料"><div><span><%= v[1] %></span><h3><%= v[2] %></h3><b><svg class="icon-arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12L12 4M4 4h8v8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></b></div></a><% }) %></div></section>
